A model in production

The `Feature store` sends to the `Trainer`, with the label `feed`. The
`Trainer` writes to the `Model registry`, with the label `write`. `Serving`
reads from the `Model registry` with the label `load`, and from the
`Feature store` with the label `read`. The `App` calls `Serving`. The `App`
must not call the `Trainer`. We guess that `Serving` sends to `Monitoring`,
with the label `log`.
---
Feature store -> Trainer: feed
Trainer -> Model registry: write
Serving -> Model registry: load
Serving -> Feature store: read
App -> Serving
App -x Trainer
Serving -> Monitoring: log ?
